// Copy this file to "Sentry.local.xcconfig" in this same directory (already gitignored) and fill
// in your own value. Never commit the real file or a real DSN.
//
// Sentry DSN (Project settings > Client Keys (DSN) in the Sentry dashboard). A DSN is client
// configuration, not a secret — it only tells the SDK where to send events — but it still must
// not be committed or hardcoded, since it identifies your own Sentry project. NEVER place a
// Sentry auth token (used for source-map/dSYM upload) here or anywhere in this app; that is
// private CI/server configuration — see docs/sentry-setup.md.
//
// Leave blank/absent to run Togetherly with crash/diagnostics reporting disabled (falls back to
// no-op diagnostics).
SENTRY_DSN=
